    title: "Verified Personal Injury Leads: What They Are and Why They Matter",
    metaTitle: "Verified Personal Injury Leads Explained",
    excerpt: "A conceptual explanation of what verified personal injury leads are and why this verification matters.",
    metaDescription: "Verification separates a genuine prospect from a wasted contact. This guide explains what verified personal injury leads are and why it matters so much.",
    category: "Personal Injury",
    readTime: "7 min read",
